THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
===================

Copy bundles no third-party media. Its alert sounds are the macOS system
sounds, played by name through NSSound.

The Swift package dependencies keep the licenses declared in their own
repositories, and CopyCore/Package.resolved pins the exact versions:

    GRDB.swift            MIT
    KeyboardShortcuts     MIT
    Sparkle               MIT

Sparkle is linked into the shipped app, so its copyright notice and permission
notice travel with the binary.
